  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">專為 DawnCraft 整合包打造的自訂職業系統。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">預設提供基礎範例職業，您可透過資料包新增更多職業或修改現有職業，範例請參考</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/SmileycorpMC/dc-classes/tree/datapack-example\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用方式：進入世界時將顯示圖形介面<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1345/858/2025-10-03_20.png\" width=\"657\" height=\"348\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">除錯時若要切換職業，請使用指令 /pickClass &lt;player&gt; &lt;class name&gt;（注意：此操作會額外發放物品）</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.gg/HJRGXq4ts7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1257940/description_96b062ac-fd45-4ba0-b076-c0f3f612a350.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\">&nbsp; 有問題或建議嗎？歡迎加入我的 Discord！</strong></a></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fsmiley\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/63aa6891-b5b5-4f3b-9ee5-ab0b7a577e98.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"678\" height=\"113\"></a></strong></p>",
